10. Development roadmap
Build the website in this order:
Project setup
Create the GitHub repository, Next.js frontend, Express backend and PostgreSQL database.
Database and API
Create the database tables, Prisma relationships, REST API endpoints and validation.
Website UI
Build the header, navigation, homepage, tour cards, destination pages and footer.
Tour management
Implement tour categories, detailed tour pages, itineraries, images and departure schedules.
Enquiry system
Connect frontend forms to the backend, save enquiries and send email notifications.
Admin dashboard
Implement administrator authentication, content management and enquiry tracking.
Testing and deployment
Test mobile responsiveness, security, loading speed, SEO, forms and API functionality before deployment.  